    "details": "<p><strong>Why the Glimpse Hackathon?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Build something real, get rewarded</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Glimpse Hackathon gives students and developers the opportunity to build products using real-world forecasting and market data.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Solve a real product or market challenge</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Top-performing teams/individuals can interview for opportunities at Glimpse</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Build something you can actually put in your portfolio</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Compete for Bitcoin prizes</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get exposure to a team building at the intersection of markets, Bitcoin and technology</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What is Glimpse?</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Glimpse is a forecasting market for financial assets. Instead of simply asking whether something will happen, Glimpse lets people forecast where the price of an asset will be at a specific point in time, and earn Bitcoin when they forecast accurately.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Users can forecast markets including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana and Gold, turning their market views into positions and seeing how their predictions compare with the crowd. For developers, Glimpse creates an interesting new dataset: what thousands of people believe will happen next.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Why take part?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Build, trade, earn and get spotted.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every eligible participant receives </span><strong>5,000 sats to start forecasting on Glimpse</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.* Participants can use those sats to explore the platform and understand the product they're building around.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Alongside the hackathon itself, participants get:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5,000 sats to experience Glimpse</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bitcoin prizes for the strongest submissions</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A real-world project for their CV/portfolio</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Exposure to Glimpse's founders and product team</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The chance for exceptional ideas to be explored further by Glimpse</span></li>\n</ul>",
